# AI Writer Hardening Rules

Goal: harden AI Writer for production. **Not** a redesign or rebuild.

## Non-negotiable

1. **Keep working features** — Do not remove anything that already works.
2. **Keep architecture** — Improve in place; no app rewrite.
3. **Keep workflows** — generate → edit → save → publish must still work the same way.
4. **Backward compatible** — Existing articles, drafts, prompts, JSON bodies keep working.
5. **Do not break integrations** — Websites, Image Generator, AI Pins, Pinterest, WordPress, Workspaces, Plans, Credits.
6. **Improve, don’t replace** — better Save Draft / stream / SEO controls in place.
7. **UI consistency** — No redesign; usability fixes only where needed.
8. **API compatibility** — Existing endpoints keep working; additive fields only.
9. **DB compatibility** — Additive migrations only; never delete collections/fields.
10. **Production-safe** — Never trade away working behavior for new work.

## Phase order

1. Production blockers → 2. UX → 3. Workflow → 4. Integrations  
**Never start the next phase until the current phase passes all regression checks.**

## Zero Regression Policy

### Before each phase
1. Analyze affected modules.
2. List every existing feature that could be impacted.
3. Preserve all existing behavior unless the change explicitly improves it.
4. Run the regression checklist after implementation.

### Regression checklist (all must pass)
- Article generation · Streaming · Drafts · SEO generation · Prompt generation
- Credits · Plan restrictions · Image Generator · AI Pins · WordPress
- Workspace isolation · No breaking API changes · No DB compatibility issues · No UI regressions

### After every phase report
- Files changed · Why · Preserved · Improved · **Regression result** · **Production readiness** · **Safe to deploy: YES / NO**

## Concrete do / don’t

```text
✅ Wire Reading/SEO/Creativity into existing prompt builder
❌ Remove those controls

✅ Keep Save Draft; improve in-place save; PATCH when id exists
❌ New draft system

✅ Burn credits on existing /integrated-ai/stream
❌ Rewrite generation stack

✅ Keep inline tool buttons; implement real rewrite in Phase 3
❌ Delete Rewrite/Expand/etc.
```
